  "DispatchArgument": [
    "CoreModules and BasicRegistrations register exact MFA1 completed ValueTask delegates. Core Boolean returns interned/name-equal true/false atoms; no context, process state, trace token or resource lookup influences predicate result.",
    "Normal qualified/unqualified auto-import and imported erlang calls resolve by SourceCallResolution/Execution target. Local functions win normal calls and local/imported shadows are rejected in guards by LocalCallValidation; no_auto_import suppresses implicit calls while explicit erlang calls remain valid. A user shadow is not an invocation of the erlang predicate.",
    "AutoImportSignatures includes all six unary names; NamedFunctionReferences produces external erlang funs, FunctionTerm.Invoke checks arity then invokes registry dispatcher. apply/3 supplies one argument through ErlangApplyDispatch; malformed apply arguments concern apply contract, not unary predicate.",
    "Semantics GuardBifs union includes Core list/PID plus Basic Guards boolean/function/port/reference. AsyncGuards evaluates arguments and awaits registry call; generic generated C# preserves Expr.Call/CallBindings and uses Execution; no distinct optimized predicate branch exists.",
    "case/if/clause/receive guards and comprehension tests share the same GuardBifs/AsyncGuards and exact Boolean checks. ComprehensionGuard honors local/imported shadow classification; no new predicate value conversion. Existing guard345 source/native diagnostics cover binding implementation independently.",
    "MatchSpec Pure includes six unary MFAs and compiler accepts them; MatchSpecProgram calls CallMatchSpecGuard directly. These six delegates return synchronously completed ValueTask independent of351 actor scheduler, because this dedicated path invokes body directly; pending-task rejection therefore cannot affect them. Pinned DBIF_ALL accepts six predicates in table/trace match-spec domains.",
    "351 normal dispatcher may schedule selected invocation, but actor execution/captured context preservation proof4F93 and sourceF8 bound here; no predicate reads actor context and no handler branch changed350\u2192351. Current351 full not yet claimed."
  ],
